        "created_at": "2015-10-15T19:43:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"Unless otherwise stated, when a Villain Character card is destroyed the heroes win\". &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Although, technically speaking, Kaargra is not being destroyed. &nbsp;But I think that you are still correct anyways.</p>",
